{"4614900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loot Hoggers", "steam_appid": 4614900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Hoggers is a 1-4 player online co-op scavenging game where you play as pint-sized goblins raiding dangerous dungeons for a demanding witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul your loot onto a shared pack-mule pig, keep it under control, and decide when to cash out. Go deeper for bigger rewards, but risk losing it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hoard the Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hostile environments and grab whatever you can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From bulky treasure to fragile oddities, every item has to make it back to be banked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the Pig</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your haul lives on one shared pack-mule pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it safe, keep it moving, and keep it under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it panics or gets distracted, your loot goes with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Your Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank early or go deeper for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more you stand to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick together and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some threats hunt you. Others target your pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it falls apart, getting out together is the only plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out with your stash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot Hoggers is a 1-4 player online co-op scavenging game where you play as pint-sized goblins raiding dangerous dungeons for a demanding witch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haul your loot onto a shared pack-mule pig, keep it under control, and decide when to cash out. Go deeper for bigger rewards, but risk losing it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hoard the Loot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hostile environments and grab whatever you can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From bulky treasure to fragile oddities, every item has to make it back to be banked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect the Pig</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your haul lives on one shared pack-mule pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep it safe, keep it moving, and keep it under control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If it panics or gets distracted, your loot goes with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Your Luck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bank early or go deeper for bigger rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more you stand to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stick together and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some threats hunt you. Others target your pig.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it falls apart, getting out together is the only plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out with your stash?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A 1-4 player online co-op scavenging game where you play as goblins raiding dangerous dungeons, stashing loot on a shared pack-mule pig, and pushing your luck to escape before losing it all.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614900/42e8d6445c4a7f638234c57256bf95219798df24/h